<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<!DOCTYPE reference PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Reference//EN" "reference.dtd">
<reference id="_Toc238560313" xml:lang="en-us">
   <title>Scenario 4: Author metadata</title>
   <shortdesc>Consider an index.md file with front matter where the input for the author field is</shortdesc>
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <keyword>metadata</keyword>
        <keyword>author</keyword>
        <keyword>notifications</keyword>
        <keyword>Author</keyword>
        <keyword>John</keyword>
        <keyword>Scenario</keyword>
        <indexterm>metadata</indexterm>
        <indexterm>author</indexterm>
        <indexterm>notifications</indexterm>
      </keywords>
      <prodinfo>
        <prodname></prodname>
      </prodinfo>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
   <refbody>  <section>
    <p>Consider an index.md file with front matter where the input for the author field is “John Doe”.</p><table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
            <title>Author metadata</title>
            <tgroup cols="2">
               <colspec colname="c1"/>
               <colspec colname="c2"/>
               <thead>
                  <row>
                     <entry>.md input </entry>
                     <entry>DITA output </entry>
                  </row>
               </thead>
               <tbody>
                  <row>
                     <entry>
                        <codeblock>+++ title = "Alarm Notifier" description = "Configure and manage alarm notifications."
  author = "John Doe"
  keywords = ["alarms","notifications","monitoring"] +++</codeblock>
                     </entry>
                     <entry>
                        <codeblock>
                           &lt;prolog&gt;
                           &lt;metadata&gt;
                           &lt;author&gt;John Doe&lt;/author&gt;
                           &lt;keywords&gt;
                           &lt;keyword&gt;alarms&lt;/keyword&gt;
                           &lt;keyword&gt;notifications&lt;/keyword&gt;          
                           &lt;keyword&gt;monitoring&lt;/keyword&gt;       
                           &lt;/keywords&gt;
                           &lt;/metadata&gt;
                           &lt;/prolog&gt;
                           &lt;title&gt;Alarm Notifier&lt;/title&gt;
                           &lt;shortdesc&gt;
                           Configure and manage alarm notifications.
                           &lt;/shortdesc&gt;
                        </codeblock>
                     </entry>
                  </row>
               </tbody>
            </tgroup>
         </table><p>
            <b>Result:</b>The author value is added inside the metadata element of the DITA file as the author element.</p>
  </section></refbody>
</reference>
